# Frontend / TS

- Convert touched JS/JSX to TS/TSX when editing if low-cost; never add new JS/JSX.
- Shared shapes in `src/types/`. Augment next-auth types in one declaration file.
- Server Components default; `'use client'` only when needed.
- Do not mount Navbar/Footer/Sidebar from both layout and page.
- Dead links: fix to canonical paths from `docs/REBUILD_PLAN.md` § Phase 2 table.
- Extract `components/ui` primitives only at 3+ call sites.
- Before unfamiliar Next APIs: read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
